 "summary": "The canonical post-PR surface is minimal and complete: the obsolete real test-vector scaffolding is deleted with no alias, the generalisable matrix lemmas are public in `Matrix` over a general index type and absent from both Mathlib and TauCeti, and `SpinDensityC` ships a full characteristic API (`*_def`, `ofReal_*`, both `IsTimeReversalInvariant` characterisations, `isParityInvariant_iff`, `@[ext]`, and the `timeReversalInvariantEquiv` round trip) with a confluent simp set. No `private` general infrastructure, no free data defeating extensionality, no duplicated names.",
